        "reason": "Explicitly corrects acid-case learner and transfer demands from A/B to concentration cB/cA (B to A), consistent with unchanged cA=0.00800 and cB=0.0160 mol/L and the original B/A=2 reference. Whole current profile and original execution requirements retained; this is an author candidate, no independent or human approval.",
